sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant B as Browser
    participant R as OpenShift Router / Gateway API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant P as oauth2-proxy sidecar<br/>4180/TCP
    participant K as OIDC issuer (Keycloak)<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant F as BFF (127.0.0.1:8080)<br/>HTTP loopback
    participant G as OpenShell gateway<br/>8080/TCP gRPC TLS 1.2+

    Note over B,G: Flow 1 - Sign-in and API request
    B->>R: GET / (HTTPS, TLS at router)<br/>No session cookie
    R->>P: Forward 4180/TCP<br/>HTTP (edge) or HTTPS (reencrypt)
    P-->>B: 302 to OIDC issuer
    B->>K: Authorization Code + PKCE (HTTPS)
    K-->>B: Redirect to /oauth2/callback
    B->>P: /oauth2/callback (via router)
    P->>K: Token exchange<br/>OIDC client secret
    K-->>P: Access + refresh token
    P-->>B: Set session cookie (Secure, HttpOnly, SameSite=lax)
    B->>R: GET /api/v1/workspaces (cookie)
    R->>P: Forward 4180/TCP
    P->>F: HTTP 127.0.0.1:8080<br/>X-Forwarded-Access-Token, X-Forwarded-User
    F->>G: gRPC (TLS, optional mTLS)<br/>authorization: Bearer access token
    G->>K: Fetch JWKS (HTTPS 443, public keys)
    G-->>F: Validate iss / aud=openshell-api / roles, then response
    F-->>P: JSON
    P-->>B: JSON (via router, TLS)

    Note over B,G: Flow 2 - Interactive terminal
    B->>R: WebSocket upgrade (wss, 443/TCP)<br/>Session cookie
    R->>P: 4180/TCP
    P->>F: --proxy-websockets<br/>/api/v1/workspaces/{ws}/sandboxes/{name}/terminal<br/>Forwarded token
    F->>F: Same-origin CheckOrigin
    F->>G: gRPC bidi exec stream (TLS)<br/>Bearer token
    G-->>F: stdout/stderr frames
    F-->>B: WebSocket frames

    Note over B,G: Flow 3 - File upload (max 64 MiB)
    B->>P: POST .../files (443 -> 4180, TLS)<br/>Session cookie
    P->>F: HTTP loopback 8080<br/>Forwarded token
    F->>G: RawExecClient.ExecWithStdin<br/>gRPC client stream, 256 KiB chunks, TLS<br/>Bearer token
    G-->>F: Exec result
    F-->>B: 200 OK
